    "careerOutlook": null,
    "learningOutcomes": "4.1. Chuan dau ra cua chuong trinh\nKhi tot nghiep, sinh vien co the:\nMa/Code\nNoi dung chuan dau ra\n1.\nChuan ve kien thirc\na.\nChuan kien thirc chung cua Truong\nHieu dugc the gioi quan,nhan sinh quan,phuong phap luan cua Chu nghia\nMac-Lenin va cua Dang Cong sanViet Nam vao hoc tap,nghien curu,vao\nPLO1.1\ndoi song thuc tien trong qua trinh phat trien nen kinh te thi truong dinh\nhuong XHCN. (PO2)\nHieu dugc kien thuc co banve phap luat,kinh te,quan trikinh doanh,quan\nPLO1.2\nly vao giai quyet cac van de kinh te-xa hoi o tam vi mo, nganh va doanh\nnghiep.(PO2,PO4)\nVan dung dugc cac kien thurc ve CNTT,cac kien thuc ve phan tich dinh\nPLO1.3\nluong vao thuc te, gan ket voi chuyen doi so  cac cap do khac nhau (PO3)\nb.\nChuan kien thurc cua nganh\nVan dung cackien thurc chuyen sau ve logistics va quan ly chuoi cung rng\nPLO1.4\ndegiai quyét cacvan de thuc tien(PO1,PO3)\nVan dungkien thurc co banve quan trikinh doanh thuongmai, thuongmai\nPLO1.5\nquoc te va thuong mai dien tir trong logistics va quan ly chuoi cung urng\n(PO1, P03)\n2.\nChuan ve ky nang\na.\nChuan ky nang chung cua truong\nKet hop (murc 4) cac ky nang sir dung CNTT co ban: sir dung may tinh; xir\nly van ban; sur dung bang tinh; su dung trinh chieu; sir dung internet...e\nPLO2.1\nhoc tap,nghien curu va ung dung thyc te(chitiet theoQuyet dinh so785/QD-\nDHKTQDngay 21/4/2020 cuaHieu truong)(PO3)\nThanh thao (murc 4) tieng Anh co ban de hoc tap,nghien curu va sir dung\nPLO2.2\ntrong thuc té. (chi tiét theo Quyet dinh so 785/QD-DHKTQD ngay\n21/4/2020 cua Hieu truong).(PO5)\nb.\nChuan ky nang cua nganh\nGiao dich damphankinhdoanh,soanthaovara soatcacvanbangiao\nPLO2.3\ndich;nang lyrc dien thuyet trong logistics va quan ly chuoi cung ung (PO5)\nPLO2.4\nThuc hien dugc cacnghiepvu co ban kinh doanh thuong mai,quan tri\n406\nthuong mai, thuong mai quoc te,hai quan,logistics,quan ly chuoi cung\nirngva thuongmai dien tir (PO1)\nb.1\nKynangap dungvoinganhchuyensauQuantri kinh doanh thuongmai\nCo kha nang phan tich, nhan dang co hoi va xay dung cac phuong an kha thi\nPLO2.5\ncho cacvan de thuc tien cua logisticsva qua ly chuoi cung ungPO3,PO4,\nPO7).\nKynang de thyc hienvai tro cuacua chuyen vien va nha Quan tri Logistics\nPLO2.6\nva Quan tri chuoi cung ung (PO1,PO5)\nKy nang khac de quan tri hoat dong logistics va cac chuoi cung rng va cac\nPLO2.7\nky nang khac de trien khai cac hoat dong logistics va quan ly chuoi cung\nirng(PO6)\n3.\nChuan ve nang lurc tur chi va trach nhiem\nThe hien dugc su ty luc khi lam viec doc lap, the hien trach nhiem ca nhan\nPLO3.1\nvatrachnhiem doivoinhomlamviec（muc5).PO1,P07\nLap ke hoach,dieu phoi,quan ly cacnguon lc,danh giava cai thien hieu\nPLO3.2\nquacachoat dng（murc5)PO1,PO4,PO7\nThe hienquan diem va bao ve quan diemca nhan dura trencach tiep can\nPLO3.3\nkhach quan, khoa hoc (murc 5). PO7\nXac dinh thuc hien trach nhiem xa hoiva dao durc nghe nghiep trong viec\nPLO3.4\ndua ra nhtng nhan dinh, danh gia ve cac van de chuyen mon (muc 4).PO2,\nPO7\n4.2.Ma tran dap irng muc tieu dao tao va chuan dau ra\nPO1\nPO2\nPO3\nPO4\nPO5\nPO6\nPO7\nPLO1.1\nX\nPLO1.2\nX\nX\nPLO1.3\nX\nPLO1.4\nX\nX\nPLO1.5\nX\nX\nPLO2.1\nX\nPLO2.2\nX\nPLO2.3\nX\nPLO2.4\nX\nPLO2.5\nX\nX\nPLO2.6\nX\nX\nPLO2.7\nX\n407\n4.3. Co hoi lam viec va kha nang hoc tap nang cao\n- Co hoi viec lam: Cir nhan Logistics va Quan ly chuoi cung ing c6 the lam viec tai\ncac co quan quan lycaccaplienquan toiviec hoach dinh chinhsach chohoat donglogistics\nva chuoi cung ung, lap ke hoach va dieu phoi tai cac nha may san xuat, tham gia dieu phoi\ncac tap doan ban le, cac cong ty tur van toan cau, cac cong ty cung ung dich vu logistics, cac\ndoanh nghiep van tai bien, duong bo, duong sat, duong thuy va duong hang khong, cac dai\nly hang khong, dai ly van tai, cang bien, ICD, cang hang khong, to churc - khai thac - quy\nhoach kho hang, bat ky cong ty va doanh nghiep nao c6 ung dung logistics trong cac hoat\ndong to churc khai thac san xuat cua doanh nghiep..\n- Kha nang hoc tap nang cao trinh do sau tot nghiep: C6 the tiep tuc theo hoc cac\nchuong trinh sau dai hoc ve logistics, quan ly chuoi cung ung, thuong mai, thuong mai dien\ntur,quan tri kinh doanh  cac truong dai hoc trong va ngoai nuoc\n5. QUY TRINH DAO TAO,DIEUKIENTOTNGHIEP\nChuong trinh dao tao theo quy che dao tao cua Bo Giao duc va Dao tao va cua Truong\nDai hoc Kinh te Quoc dan. Ké hoach dao tao chuan la 04 nam, sinh vien c6 the tot nghiep\nsom hoacmuon theo quy dinh.\nSinh vien dugc cong nhan tot nghiep neu dap ung du cac dieu kien sau day:\na) Tich liy di hoc phan, so tin chi va dat chuan dau ra ngoai ngu, tin hoc cua chuong\ntrinh dao tao;\nb) Diem trung binh tich luy cua toan khoa hoc dat tir trung binh tro lén;\nc) Co churng chi Giao duc quoc phong - an ninh va hoan thanh hoc phan Giao duc thé\nchat;\nd) Hoan thanh “Tuan sinh hoat cong dan-sinh vien\" va dat diem danh gia ren luyen\ntheo quy dinh doi voi sinh vien dai hoc chinh quy;\nd) Tai thoi diem xet tot nghiep khong bi truy cuu trach nhiem hinh su hoac khong\ndang trong thoi gian bi ky luat o murc dinh chi hoc tap.\n6.CAUTRUCVANQI DUNGCUACHUONGTRINHDAOTAO\n6.1. Cau truc cua churong trinh\nThanh phan\nS6\nGhi chu\nTC\n1.Giao duc dai curong\n47\n1.1.\nCac hoc phan chung\n14\nLy luan chinh tri va phap luat\n1.2.\nCac hoc phan chung cua truong\n21\n4 hoc phan chung va ngoai ngir\n1.3.\nCachocphan chung cua linh vuc\n12\n4hocphan chung cua linh vuc\n1.4.\nGiaoduc thechat\n3tin chi\n1.5.\nGiao duc Quoc phong-An ninh\n165 tiet/8 tin chi quy doi\n2.Giao duc chuyen nghiep\n83\n408",
